# Plain Browser patches, applied after ungoogled-chromium-windows patches.
# Each entry is a path relative to patches/. Patches must be generated against
# the pinned Chromium tag (see versions.toml).
# After applying these, run scripts/vendor-adblock-crates.ps1 (gnrt vendor + gen); see docs/ADBLOCK.md.
#
# Two scripts also edit the Chromium tree and are NOT listed here (keep this list in sync with them):
#   scripts/apply-branding.py     product name in *_chromium_strings*.grd(p) + .xtb and chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
#   scripts/post-gnrt-fixups.ps1  windows-rs import libs in third_party/rust/windows_*_msvc BUILD.gn after gnrt
# Rule: no Google hostnames in hunks. ungoogled's domain substitution rewrites them after patching, so a hunk
# that contains one applies in one flow (prepare.py, before substitution) and fails in the other
# (apply-plainbrowser.ps1, after). Add our own constant next to the upstream one instead.
# scripts/check-patches.py dry-runs this series against any ungoogled-chromium-windows tag without a checkout.
